# =============================================================================
#  CH585D_Board_Test  -  Git ignore rules
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  WCH official CH585 example SDK
#  Kept in the working tree as local reference material only; deliberately NOT
#  tracked, so the repository stays small and contains only this project's code.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
EXAM/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Build output
#  WCH / MounRiver Studio projects emit every intermediate and final artifact
#  into a per-project `obj/` directory, so ignoring it is sufficient.
#  NOTE: `*.hex` is deliberately NOT ignored globally, because the BLE ROM
#  firmware images shipped under `LIB/` are real source assets required for
#  linking/flashing (e.g. CH585BLE_ROMx.hex).
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
obj/
Debug/
Release/

# Stray artefacts, in case a build ever writes outside `obj/`
*.o
*.d
*.su
*.elf
*.map
*.lst
*.bin

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  IDE / toolchain session state  (machine-local, not part of the project)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.mrs/
*.mrs-workspace
*-.snapshot
.wvproj.user

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Editors
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.bak
*~

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Operating-system junk
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Never ignore: prebuilt vendor ROM images and link-time libraries
#  (negations must come last)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
!CH585D/LIB/*.hex
!**/*.a
